#. module: om_whatsapp_followup
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_whatsapp_followup
msgid ""
"Bridge between the Customer Follow Up Management of Odoo Mates and its "
"WhatsApp connector: each follow-up level can send a WhatsApp message with "
"the amount overdue and the list of overdue invoices with their online "
"payment links, along with its other actions, by hand or from the daily "
"automatic follow-ups. Every message is kept in the chatter of the customer."
msgstr ""

